<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan Feb average wage 14.4 pct down mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan Feb average wage 14.4 pct down mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wages in Kazakhstan averaged $100.8 in February, down 14.4 percent from January, the National Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following Kazakhstan wage data --</p>
<p>    KAZAKH AVERAGE WAGE		     Jan '97	 Jan '96</p>
<p>    Paid in the national tenge currency   7,506	   8,770</p>
<p>    Equivalent in dollars		     100.8	   121.0</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change		 -14.4	   +13.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
